## Key Flows

### 1. Hiring Pipeline
```
Manager creates requisition → HR approves → Job posting created → Published to career page + LinkedIn → Candidate applies → Kanban pipeline → Interview scheduled (.ics) → Feedback submitted → Offer created → PDF generated → Sent with e-signature → Candidate accepts → Employee auto-created → Onboarding auto-assigned
```

### 2. API Endpoints Created

**Recruitment** (~25 endpoints):
- `POST/GET /v1/requisitions` — CRUD + `POST /:id/approve`, `POST /:id/cancel`
- `POST/GET /v1/job-postings` — CRUD + `POST /:id/publish|pause|close`
- `GET /v1/public/jobs` — Public career page (no auth)
- `POST /v1/public/jobs/:id/apply` — Public application
- `POST/GET /v1/candidates` — CRUD + `GET /v1/job-postings/:id/pipeline` (Kanban)
- `POST /v1/applications/:id/move-stage` — Pipeline transitions
- `POST/GET /v1/interviews` — CRUD + `POST /:id/feedback`, `GET /:id/ics`
- `POST/GET /v1/offers` — CRUD + `POST /:id/generate-pdf|approve|send|revoke`
- `GET/POST /v1/public/offers/:token` — Public view/respond
- `POST /v1/webhooks/docusign` — DocuSign callback

**Onboarding** (~12 endpoints):
- `POST/GET /v1/onboarding/checklists` — Template CRUD + `POST /:id/assign`
- `GET /v1/onboarding/my` — Employee self-service
- `GET /v1/onboarding/instances` — HR management
- `POST /v1/onboarding/tasks/:id/complete|skip`
- `POST /v1/onboarding/documents/requests` — HR creates
- `GET /v1/onboarding/documents/my` — Employee views
- `POST /v1/onboarding/documents/:id/presign-upload|complete-upload|approve|reject`

